KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
WAEC - Chemistry (Year 2023)

Q1. Which of the following compounds exhibits strong intermolecular hydrogen bonding?
  (A) CH4
  (B) H2S
  (C) NH3
  (D) HCl
  Answer: C - NH3 contains N-H bonds that form strong hydrogen bonds.


